# RFC 2180 section 4.1.2 says:
#  The server MAY allow the EXPUNGE of a multi-accessed mailbox,
#  and on subsequent FETCH commands return FETCH responses only for
#  non-expunged messages and a tagged NO.
depends 2180base
send 1
a store 1,3 +flags.silent \deleted
receive 1
a OK done
send 1
a expunge
receive 3
* 1 EXPUNGE
* 2 EXPUNGE
a OK done
use watcher
send 1
d uid fetch 2,4 uid
receive 5
* 2 FETCH (UID 2)
* 4 FETCH (UID 4)
* 1 EXPUNGE
* 2 EXPUNGE
d OK done
end
